<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Grain reports nine-month loss.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Grain reports nine-month loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Grain Elevators Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,975.97    vs	1,867.12</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)	 (52.73)    vs	  130.78</p>
<p>    Tax provision		 10.08    vs	   25.41</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Grain Elevators mills animal feed and produces day-old chicks. The company was badly hit by rising world food grain prices and power cuts in early 1996, analysts said. -- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
